0c38b8e9-54e5-42ae-9d3a-61bfbc8823ac	1	Whispers of Destiny	In the vibrant realm of Eldoria, where the air shimmered with the essence of magic, Kaelin tended to her garden of herbs, each leaf glistening like emeralds kissed by sunlight. The towering Auroral Peaks loomed in the distance, their snow-capped summits reflecting hues of violet and gold as dusk approached. As she plucked a sprig of moonshade, a rustle in the Luminous Forest caught her attention, sending a shiver down her spine.\n\nHer heart raced; tales of the Wraithlord haunted the villagers’ whispers, a shadowy figure siphoning magic, leaving despair in his wake. "What if he comes here?" she murmured, fear knotting her stomach. But deep within, a flicker of power stirred, a call to adventure that echoed through her veins like an ancient song. Kaelin glanced at the horizon, where the sun dipped below the peaks, igniting her resolve. The prophecy had awakened something within her—a destiny she could no longer ignore.		153	English	literary	1	t	2026-01-28 08:14:34.468032+00	2026-01-28 08:14:34.468425+00	\N	eaadfe8c-9e78-407e-9ee5-139bca82c5a6	\N	1	1.000000
